@mainpage ACMX2 — Real-Time GPU-Accelerated Video Glitch Engine

@htmlonly
<p><img src="https://lostsidedead.biz/screenshot3.jpg?v=1" style="max-width:800px; width:80%; height:auto;" /></p>
<p><img src="https://lostsidedead.biz/screenshot4.jpg?v=1" alt="Sreenshot1" style="max-width:800px; width:80%; height:auto;" /></p>
