- [Project Documentation](https://lostsidedead.biz/acmx2-explained.html)
- [GPU Filters Explained](https://lostsidedead.biz/acmx2/filter_browser.html)
- [Example Shaders](https://lostsidedead.biz/acmx2/shader_browser.html)
